---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { BRAND_EMAIL } from '../lib/brand';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Contact Us — Pickraft"
  description="Get in touch with Pickraft. Questions, feedback, bug reports, and privacy inquiries."
  canonical="/contact"
  heading="Contact Us"
>
  <section>
    <h2 class="type-subheading mb-3">Get in touch</h2>
    <p>
      Have a question, found a bug, or want to share feedback? We'd like to hear from you. The
      easiest way to reach us is by email.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="type-subheading mb-3">Email</h2>
    <p>
      <a href={`mailto:${BRAND_EMAIL}`} class="text-link hover:underline">{BRAND_EMAIL}</a>
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3">
      We aim to respond within a few business days. Please include as much detail as you can —
      which tool you used, your browser and device, and what went wrong if you're reporting an
      issue.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="type-subheading mb-3">What you can contact us about</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
      <li>Questions about how a tool works</li>
      <li>Bug reports or conversion issues</li>
      <li>Feature suggestions and feedback</li>
      <li>Privacy and data handling questions</li>
      <li>Terms of service inquiries</li>
      <li>Partnership or business enquiries</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="type-subheading mb-3">Privacy questions</h2>
    <p>
      Pickraft processes images locally in your browser — we do not receive or store your files. For
      full details on what data we may collect when you visit the site, see our
      <a href="/privacy" class="text-link hover:underline">privacy policy</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="type-subheading mb-3">Before you write</h2>
    <p>
      Many common questions are answered on our tool pages and in each tool's FAQ section. If
      you're having trouble with a specific conversion, try a different browser or check that your
      file format is supported before reaching out.
    </p>
  </section>
</LegalLayout>
